<p>The end plazas, their spires, and the adjacent lower-level parks are illuminated at night. Lighting also marks the five pedestrian overlooks, their flagpoles, and the underside of the bridge.</p>

<p>The North Dakota Department of Transportation produced a <a href="https://youtu.be/cUN_VXeIQdQ?feature=shared">video about the 1922 and 2008 Liberty Memorial bridges</a> as part of the historical and cultural mitigation associated with removing the original bridge.</p>
